// A missing item throws and is loud. An EMPTY TAG is silent: the recipe registers, shows a blank
// ingredient slot in EMI, and can never be crafted. That is the 1.20 -> 1.21 hazard, because the
// community tag namespace moved from `forge:` to `c:` and the old names still parse while matching
// nothing. Tags bind during the reload and this runs inside it, so CANARY_TAG separates "empty"
// from "not bound yet".
